<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72629" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄϊος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ʽὄϊσ̓</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of a sheep,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλα ὄ.</span>
			<i>ewe</i>-milk, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				2.41
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄϊον ἔριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polem.Hist.
					88
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰὸς οἰότερον</span>
			<i>more sheepish</i> than a sheep, <i><span class="en">
				Sophr.
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				122
			</span></i> (v. dub.). (In <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> and Polem.Hist.ll.cc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄειος</span> (like <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόειος</span>)
			shd. be read ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀέα.</span>)</div>
